        ],
        "text": "In 2008 Congress overhauled the terrorism exception to foreign sovereign immunity to allow victims to execute judgments against foreign states."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Asher Perlin (Petitioner)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3a29d12a7507d03c24a2831d78b13c75334da576cb6147f66173b45a0b8bf823",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3a29d12a7507-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 4
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "3a29d12a7507d03c24a2831d78b13c75334da576cb6147f66173b45a0b8bf823",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3a29d12a7507-0000-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Asher Perlin (Petitioner), according to Asher Perlin (Petitioner), according to Asher Perlin (Petitioner), section\u202f1610(g) provides a remedy for American terrorism victims to execute judgments on foreign state property while preserving a bare minimum of sovereign immunity for quintessentially sovereign assets."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3a29d12a7507d03c24a2831d78b13c75334da576cb6147f66173b45a0b8bf823",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3a29d12a7507-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 12,
              "start": 12
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked whether the definition of \u201cforeign state\u201d in the statute includes agencies or instrumentalities, potentially affecting the scope of execution."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3a29d12a7507d03c24a2831d78b13c75334da576cb6147f66173b45a0b8bf823",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3a29d12a7507-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether the legislative record shows Congress intended to dispense with the \u201cBancec.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3a29d12a7507d03c24a2831d78b13c75334da576cb6147f66173b45a0b8bf823",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3a29d12a7507-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor later asked for clarification of the argument presented."
      }
    ],
