        "text": "According to Asher Perlin (Petitioner), according to Asher Perlin (Petitioner), according to Asher Perlin (Petitioner), petitioners seek to execute judgments against Iran under Section\u202f1610(g) of the Foreign Sovereign Immunities Act."
